'''Revolutionary Nobunaga''' (反逆の戦国魔王・織田信長, ''Hangyaku no Sengoku Maō・Oda Nobunaga'', '''Rebellious Sengoku Demon King - Oda Nobunaga''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy introduced in 12th Anniversary stages. He is an enemy counterpart of [[Oda Nobunaga (Uber Rare Cat)|Wargod Nobunaga]]. He was added in [[Version 14.0 Update|Version 14.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Revolutionary Nobunaga
|image = E 707.png
|first appearance = [[Despot's Ambition (Normal)]]
|money drop = 4,350¢ - 17,182¢
}}

==Enemy==
Despite his low base stats, Revolutionary Nobunaga can be very deadly at times due to his high strength magnifications in later stages, his Omni Strike that can reach up to 510 range and his guaranteed 6-second freeze. He also has [[Counter-Surge]], likely referencing the [[Ultra Form]] of the [[Oda Nobunaga (Uber Rare Cat)|original Cat Unit]], and is immune to knockback, though this doesn't matter much.

==Strategy==
In earlier stages, use [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Swimmer Cat]] or [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kotatsu Cat]] to solo this enemy.

