==Trivia==
*Revolutionary Nobunaga appearing with [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angels]] in [[Despot's Ambition (Expert)]] and [[Despot's Ambition (Deadly)]] and [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] in [[Despot's Ambition (Merciless)]] may be a reference to how the real [[wikipedia:Oda Nobunaga|Oda Nobunaga]] is sometimes referred to as the "Demon King of the Sixth Heaven".
*Along with [[Nuclear Dragon King Berius (PC Enemy)|Nuclear Dragon King Berius]], [[Possessed Empress]] and [[Ensanglion the Calamity]], he is one of the four non-collab enemies to be a counterpart of a [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]].

